WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.925
They told us the sun would always rise.

2
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.100
HARUTO: Then we'll drag it back up ourselves.

3
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.850
Before the Eclipse, the sky had a voice.

4
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.900
On the island of Amatsu, the Star Choir sang the heavens into balance.

5
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.100
NOCTURNE: Sing with me, little star. Our song will never end.

6
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.500
On the highest island, two orphans trained beneath the sacred tree.

7
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.825
They grew up as brothers.

8
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.350
Only one of them was given the guardian's seal.

9
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.925
The other never forgot it.

10
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:20.250
Far below, in the neon rain of Neo-Kurogane, Raijin never lost a duel.

11
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.150
His mother taught him the sword.

12
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.975
His mother's blade was struck by lightning the night they buried her.

13
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:42.025
In Hangar Zero, a mechanic's son swept the floor beneath two sleeping giants.

14
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.825
Its heart was a captured piece of the sun.

15
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:54.875
VORN: Never hold back, Haruto. Not in the cockpit. Not in life.

16
00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:03.400
And at Zenith Academy, Yuzu could split a falling leaf at three hundred metres.

17
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.350
YUZU: I'll always be the better shot, little brother. Always.

18
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:20.650
Then, on the longest day of the year, the sun went black.

19
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.525
The sky tore open. They called it the Eclipse Rift.

20
00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:43.150
The prima voice traded her light for a song that would never end.

21
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.775
NOCTURNE: Forgive me, little star.

22
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.675
KAGEMARU: Seals mean nothing. I'll prove it.

23
00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.525
KAIEN: Kagemaru... why?

24
00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:06.600
Beneath Neo-Kurogane, something that had slept for a thousand years woke up hungry.

25
00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:12.675
ENRA: That blade. I remember that blade.

26
00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:29.500
And the man who taught Haruto never to hold back stole the black giant and walked out into the dark.

27
00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.050
HARUTO: Why, sensei?

28
00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.275
YUZU: Little brother! No!

29
00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.950
HEX: Such a promising student.

30
00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.975
They called themselves the Umbra Syndicate.

31
00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:17.550
Mirei stitched her wings from the stars she had sung to.

32
00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:33.800
Kaien left his mountain for the first time, with ten thousand talismans and one name.

33
00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.125
RAIJIN: Laugh while you can, oni.

34
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.700
YUZU: Hold on. I'm coming to get you.

35
00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.900
HARUTO: We could use a blade like that.

36
00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.725
RAIJIN: Try to keep up.

37
00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.525
HARUTO: Wake up, Tenkai-Oh! We're not holding back!

38
00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:23.000
Five who refused to let the dark win.

39
00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.325
ALL: Zenith Vanguard!

40
00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:38.300
The Syndicate came for the city on the night of the crimson moon.

41
00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.975
KAIEN: Go! The seals will hold!

42
00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:50.400
NOCTURNE: You still sing my lullaby, little star.

43
00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.400
MIREI: Then listen to it!

44
00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.825
For a moment, the diva remembered the girl.

45
00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.550
KAGEMARU: Your seals are paper, brother.

46
00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:19.250
KAIEN: Paper that remembers who we were.

47
00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.300
ENRA: Burn with your district, boy!

48
00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:38.025
RAIJIN: Thunder... Parry!

49
00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.325
HEX: Which one is real, little archer?

50
00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.825
YUZU: Found you.

51
00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.050
The doll whispered her name.

52
00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:14.900
VORN: You've grown, Haruto. Let's see if you listened.

53
00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.000
HARUTO: Dawn Charge!

54
00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.150
VORN: This is what power looks like.

55
00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.525
VORN: Hold back, and you lose everything.

56
00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.100
HARUTO: You taught me never to hold back!

57
00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.725
Four lights answered.

58
00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.600
HARUTO: This sun... never sets!

59
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.550
And the sun rose.

60
00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.575
YUZU: I'll find you. I promise.

61
00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.650
VORN: Good. Never hold back.

62
00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:22.275
They called themselves the Zenith Vanguard. And the war had only just begun.

63
00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:29.300
QEL'VARIS: Fascinating. A sun that refuses to set.

